      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, a professional standalone roof inspection typically costs between $100 and $400, with the average baseline sitting around $190.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $100 and $400"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "However, many local contractors offer free visual inspections if you are seeking a repair or replacement quote. If you need a formal, certified written report for an insurance claim or a real estate transaction, you should expect to pay a dedicated fee."
      },
      {
